            "exact_scalar": false,
            "value": "Named because N2 of DEC-20260822-7d356e directs this candidate to be filed under this goal and question, and because the goal's committed RANK 2 next_action is exactly this filing. Naming is not dispatch and authorizes nothing; only a Coordinator decision does. No hypothesis is bound: per the idea schema precedent (IDEA-20260905-9f7bc1, IDEA-20260829-01cbc5) an idea carries question/goal bindings only, and inventing a hypothesis binding is forbidden by the handoff."
          },
          {
            "token": "IDEA-20260905-9f7bc1",
            "field": "idea.ranking_against_open_ecrank_ideas",
            "exact_scalar": false,
            "value": "Against the five open RQ-ECRANK-27dcc5 proposals (tools/ecc_priority.py --open-ideas): (1) IDEA-20260829-01cbc5 (prio high) -- complementary, not duplicative (novelty_screen); it ranks AHEAD of this record where an external witness is admissible input (degree-2 rung, minutes of verification), and this record ranks ahead under the goal's committed narrower framing (\"what does THIS construction reach\"), where external inputs do not count and it is the ONLY one of the five attacking the multi-class construction problem directly. (2) IDEA-20260829-173a32 (prio high) -- measurement, not construction; it ranks AHEAD on cost for pool-scope totals (small- coefficient curves, trivial descent) and BEHIND on the only axis not blocked at constructed-curve scale (its per-class descents are the 31/31-timeout engine of O-07). (3) IDEA-20260829-d53906 (prio high) -- upstream complement: its F_l certifier is this record's within-class instrument; neither dominates. (4) IDEA-20260829-c7472b (prio medium) -- orthogonal control: it would CLASSIFY this record's eventual rungs (exact eigenspace + F_l = recomputable/cited kinds; the numerical regulator cross-check stays out of the claim). (5) IDEA-20260905-9f7bc1 (prio high) -- downstream consumer: it optimizes field degree GIVEN certified per-class witnesses; this record produces such witnesses for the degree-8 rung. This record's own recommended priority: medium-high -- cheaper than any wider Mestre scan, the only unblocked route in view per N2's why-clause, but its first experiment lands BELOW the committed fixture on the raw-total axis (sota_delta axis A is negative) and its C1-relevant step P4 is unpriced."
          }
        ]
